  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nThe UI library for building fast and beautiful apps in WinForms, .NET, C#, VB.NET and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\n- Back up all your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Read about the changes, enhancements and improvements BEFORE updating.\n- Contact us if you have any questions BEFORE updating your library.\n------------------------------\n\n⚡ENHANCED COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Currency Textbox\n\n\n🔥NEW COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Data Grid View\n# Siticone Pips Pager Advanced\n# Siticone Phone Number Box Advanced\n# Siticone Email Textbox Advanced\n# Siticone Tags Input\n# Siticone Stepped Progress Indicator\n# Siticone Menu Button Advanced\n# Siticone Navigator Button",
